{
    "title": "Jelly Dye: Jelly Games & ASMR",
    "description": "Submerge yourself in the sensory delight of Jelly Dye, an entrancing ASMR game experience where jelly games and tie dye games intersect. This is a realm of shimmering hues and malleable, captivating jellies.\r\n\r\nYour mission? Fill the delicate ASMR jellies in dye patterns. At the pinnacle of your screen lies a rainbow jelly model for you to mirror. How, you ask? Effortlessly! Handpick your colors from the assortment below, then prep your syringe with the ideal blend.\r\n\r\nWith straightforward controls tailored for ASMR games, aim your needle at portions of the rainbow jelly craving some color infusion. Gently tap the button, immersing yourself in the ASMR sensation as the dye engulfs the jelly, melding and spreading in a serene visual ballet.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- 3D Graphics: Venture into a world where ASMR jellies shimmer, reflecting light, wobbling, and quivering in true jelly game fashion.\r\n- Intuitive Controls: Crafted precisely for ASMR games; a simple tap and swipe will let you select, dye, and experience the jelly fill.\r\n- Strategic Coloring: Jelly games are more than just filling! Handpick the apt colors and pinpoint the best injection sites for a match that mirrors the rainbow jelly model.\r\n- ASMR Relaxation: Absent of a ticking timer, immerse in the ASMR ambiance of Jelly Dye at your leisure. Delve deep, relax, and get entranced by the sensory world of tie dye games.\r\n- Mesmerizing Designs: Every stage offers a fresh jelly fill challenge and hue puzzle, ensuring an ever-refreshing ASMR experience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're seeking a brief ASMR relaxing game or a prolonged evening of jelly games, Jelly Dye is the perfect amalgamation of tranquility and color challenge. Its calming visuals and the gentle pace of jelly fill make it the go-to for ASMR enthusiasts and jelly game aficionados alike. Dive in and let the rainbow jelly hues envelope you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Submerge yourself in the sensory delight of Jelly Dye, an entrancing ASMR game experience where jelly games and tie dye games intersect. This is a realm of shimmering hues and malleable, captivating jellies.<br><br>Your mission? Fill the delicate ASMR jellies in dye patterns. At the pinnacle of your screen lies a rainbow jelly model for you to mirror. How, you ask? Effortlessly! Handpick your colors from the assortment below, then prep your syringe with the ideal blend.<br><br>With straightforward controls tailored for ASMR games, aim your needle at portions of the rainbow jelly craving some color infusion. Gently tap the button, immersing yourself in the ASMR sensation as the dye engulfs the jelly, melding and spreading in a serene visual ballet.<br><br>Features:<br><br>- 3D Graphics: Venture into a world where ASMR jellies shimmer, reflecting light, wobbling, and quivering in true jelly game fashion.<br>- Intuitive Controls: Crafted precisely for ASMR games; a simple tap and swipe will let you select, dye, and experience the jelly fill.<br>- Strategic Coloring: Jelly games are more than just filling! Handpick the apt colors and pinpoint the best injection sites for a match that mirrors the rainbow jelly model.<br>- ASMR Relaxation: Absent of a ticking timer, immerse in the ASMR ambiance of Jelly Dye at your leisure. Delve deep, relax, and get entranced by the sensory world of tie dye games.<br>- Mesmerizing Designs: Every stage offers a fresh jelly fill challenge and hue puzzle, ensuring an ever-refreshing ASMR experience.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re seeking a brief ASMR relaxing game or a prolonged evening of jelly games, Jelly Dye is the perfect amalgamation of tranquility and color challenge. Its calming visuals and the gentle pace of jelly fill make it the go-to for ASMR enthusiasts and jelly game aficionados alike. Dive in and let the rainbow jelly hues envelope you!",
    "summary": "Fill the jelly with colors! ASMR jelly games with tie dye patterns!",
